<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-CA">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <title>Inventory Manager | Reviiv Motors</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <a href="/" aria-label="Reviiv Motors home"><img src="/reviiv-logo-poster.png" alt="Reviiv Motors" width="185" height="126" /></a>
      <p class="kicker">PRIVATE INVENTORY MANAGER</p>
      <h1>Your inventory.<br /><span>In your hands.</span></h1>
      <p>Add vehicles, upload photos, and change Available or Sold status in your secure dashboard.</p>
      <a class="button" href="https://app.pagescms.org/reviivmotors/reviivmotors/main">Open Inventory Dashboard</a>
      <p class="note">Sign in with your connected account, then open Reviiv Motors → Vehicle Inventory. Saved changes appear after the site's automatic rebuild.</p>
      <a class="back" href="/">Back to the website</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #0c0c0e; color: #f4f1f8; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
  main { width: min(520px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 6vh auto; padding-bottom: 40px; }
  img { display: block; object-fit: contain; }
  .kicker { color: #c084f7; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 32px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 54px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
  h1 span { color: #c084f7; }
  p { color: #bcb5c4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 50px; padding: 14px 22px; margin-block: 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: #79459b; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; }
  .button:hover { background: #9254ba; }
  .note { font-size: 12px; }
  .back { display: inline-block; color: #cfb2e4; font-size: 13px; padding-block: 14px; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #c084f7; outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 430px) { .button { width: 100%; } }
</style>
